  "summary": "ACCEPT. The unchanged recovery candidate is commit 1a0c40985cf1074ec3bb137d3a7538d7e5e94322, tree 89e9f25c15d744c09b3895b39761eb687b8e01e1, and exact base-to-candidate binary diff SHA-256 f1839e6c3258dc3c58295c36250b2880ef904e50baafc96cc23dbde4e7d88b62. QR-115-008-001 is closed: corrected ignored candidate metadata contains 566257218b466652d0394ec62754fc07d398fa2b2ac23e989ba49dab1fdc2dcc, and an independent in-memory execution of the repository-authoritative CreateProductionSourceManifest algorithm, reusing the compiled helper's exact IsDockerIgnored matcher across 1,259 included tracked entries, returned the same commit, tree, and hash. Direct reflection invocation also proved the helper's clean-context guard remains fail-closed; it stopped only because the required preserved iteration-8 verdict is intentionally untracked. QR-115-007-001 remains closed in raw code and tests: the host enforces the exact result field set, rejects duplicate/unknown/missing data, binds the active nonce, validates every declared identity/count/constant including CodeGraphContext 0.5.1 and requirements.lock, recomputes contentHash, size-bounds/sanitizes result.json, and hashes accepted bytes. QR-115-007-002 remains closed: the harness requires a clean candidate, freshly publishes before the sole image build, hashes exactly three read-only driver files with candidate-commit and immutable /app-inventory binding, revalidates immediately before provisioner creation, rejects replacements/collisions/missing attestations, and retains sanitized result/driver/image/mount evidence. Iteration 8's bounded non-live combined filter passed 83/83; no optional suite was repeated. Raw review reconfirmed the accepted BMad AC-1 through AC-3 and SpecKit FR-001 through FR-024/SC-001 through SC-011 coverage for T001-T071, the exact seven-slot Pass 2 surface, fail-closed authorization/currentness/citation and cleanup seams, one-build same-image Option A boundary, and truthful pending T072/T073 limitations. Git comparison shows no migration, model, Dockerfile, or package-reference delta; tracked candidate content is unchanged, git diff --check passes, and the only pre-verdict status entry was the allowed untracked iteration-8 verdict. There are zero unresolved findings and zero new Critical/High findings. T072 is accepted-safe to activate once the root validates this persisted verdict against the same boundary; this verdict does not claim that T072/T073 or any live Docker, PostgreSQL, provider, Repository, CodeGraph, browser, network, or Playwright action has run."
